                            7
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْهَزَمَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It</i> (an army) <i>was routed, discomfited,
defeated,</i> or <i>put to flight.</i> (K, &amp;c.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاصَ</span>,
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حيص</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْحَازَ</span>, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حوز</span>; from both
of which it is distinguished.

